ID  - 42346344
TI  - Lean Mass and Musculoskeletal Preservation in GLP-1-Based Obesity Treatment: Nutrition, Exercise, Supplementation, and Monitoring Strategies.
AU  - Šantić Roko
AU  - Martinović Lovre
AU  - Pavlović Nikola
AU  - Rušić Doris
AU  - Kumrić Marko
