TI  - Skeletal muscle mitochondrial impairment in patients with newly diagnosed multiple sclerosis revealed by ¹H/³¹P magnetic resonance spectroscopy.
AU  - Kollár Branislav
AU  - Penesová Adela
AU  - Klepochová Radka
AU  - Šiarnik Pavel
AU  - Vlček Miroslav
